### Books - Book club reading endpoints
### Run each request by clicking the ▶ next to "###" (Android Studio / IntelliJ).
### Prerequisites: an existing book club (book-clubs.http) and a book (books.http).

@host = http://localhost:8080

### List all readings
GET {{host}}/api/book-club-readings
Accept: application/json

### Get a reading by id
GET {{host}}/api/book-club-readings/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a reading (201)
POST {{host}}/api/book-club-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookClubId": 1,
  "bookId": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-07-01",
  "endDate": "2026-07-31",
  "meetLink": "https://meet.example.com/sci-fi-july",
  "address": "Central Library, Room 2"
}

### Same club reading ANOTHER book in ANOTHER period (201)
POST {{host}}/api/book-club-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookClubId": 1,
  "bookId": 2,
  "startDate": "2026-08-01",
  "endDate": "2026-08-31"
}

### Conflict: same club + same date range (409)
### -> "you'r book club is already reading a book for these dates"
POST {{host}}/api/book-club-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookClubId": 1,
  "bookId": 2,
  "startDate": "2026-07-01",
  "endDate": "2026-07-31"
}

### Update a reading (200)
PUT {{host}}/api/book-club-readings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookClubId": 1,
  "bookId": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-07-01",
  "endDate": "2026-07-15",
  "meetLink": "https://meet.example.com/updated",
  "address": "Online only"
}

### Create with a non-existent book club (404)
POST {{host}}/api/book-club-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookClubId": 9999,
  "bookId": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "endDate": "2026-09-30"
}

### Invalid create (400 - required fields missing)
POST {{host}}/api/book-club-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "meetLink": "https://meet.example.com/x"
}

### Delete a reading (204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/book-club-readings/1
